# Web kids vibe (approved)

**Source of truth:** the shipping auth screens (`/`, `/login`, `/register`, `/onboarding/grade`). Match that energy on any new student UI. Duolingo-inspired patterns only — not a clone (no Duo, Feather/DIN, hearts, gems, Super).

## Feel

- Game for grades 1–5, not a textbook or SaaS form.
- One job per screen. Big type, few controls, friendly Vietnamese copy.
- Chunky “pressable” controls (ledge shadow). Celebrate correct; soft wrong — never hearts.

